WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.272
Today is the final check. It takes about four minutes.

2
00:00:03.722 --> 00:00:08.360
Your child uses their page. You have the grown-up page. Keep it turned away.

3
00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:15.728
It has the same parts as day one. Hearing the sounds. The letter for a sound. Then words. Then one sentence.

4
00:00:16.178 --> 00:00:17.301
Do not help today.

5
00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:24.896
The eight words matter most. Your child has never practiced them, and there are no boxes. So memory cannot help.

6
00:00:25.346 --> 00:00:29.775
Write the three numbers on your page. Then put it beside the page from day one.

7
00:00:30.225 --> 00:00:34.423
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

8
00:00:34.873 --> 00:00:40.382
If the words are not there yet, that is a result too. The page tells you which days to do again.

9
00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:45.501
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
